# Keeps the image to the tracked source: nothing regenerable, private or secret.

# --- version control and local tooling ---
.git
.gitignore
.vscode
CLAUDE.md

# --- data, envelopes and derived beds (regenerable, sometimes sensitive) ---
**/.data
**/.envelope
**/.envelopes
**/.loam
plots/*/harvest
harvest/reports
harvest/maps
harvest/exports
harvest/dashboards
compost/logs
compost/archive
garden/reference

# --- Terraform state, plans and variables ---
**/.terraform
**/*.tfstate
**/*.tfstate.backup
**/*.tfvars
!**/*.example.tfvars
**/*.plan

# --- secrets and credentials ---
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.keystore
**/*.p12
**/.aws
**/credentials
**/*_credentials.json
**/*service-account*.json
**/.secrets

# --- caches and build artifacts ---
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/*.egg-info
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.ipynb_checkpoints
**/.Rproj.user
**/.Rhistory
**/.RData

# --- large binaries kept out of git ---
**/*.joblib
**/*.pt
**/*.DNG
